From b7fa9997c95ed776a808e790d7a6eab12731ba0e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefan <kloterstefan@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 03:20:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/19] Vizz 2.0: the name on the unit, its identity FM-1_820,
 its one-file installer

Vizz 2.0 is a modified version of Skiff 2.0.1 for the VIZZ visualizer,
as Vizz 1.0 was of Skiff 1.4 (its patch 0005, on 2.0). What the unit
shows says so; code, comments and files keep Skiff's names, and every
credit and licence stays:

- the splash: Vizz, v2.0, on Skiff 2.0.1; ABOUT: VIZZ, based on Skiff
  2.0.1 / Felucca, and the credits open with VIZZ (what it changes) and
  SKIFF (illuminus5); the crash screen VIZZ CRASH; the update loader's
  screens the VIZZ INSTALLER (its font: V and Z); MENU > THEME shows the
  default as VIZZ (the editor's theme list keeps SKIFF)
- the version v2.0 (FELUCCA_VERSION; build.py --release 2.0)
- the identity FM-1_800, a release FM-1_8XY (Skiff's 7XY, Felucca's
  9XY): Vizz 2.0 is FM-1_820; the package vizz-X.Y.fwsc
- L, the large face: Z (ABOUT's VIZZ), the pixel face too
- the USB names and descriptors stay the FM-1's
- web/make_vizz_installer.py: Skiff 2.0's installer page (index_pkg.html)
  as one file, the package and the converter (build/conv/conv.wasm) in it
  as data: URLs, its words Vizz's. Its way over firmware before 2.0
  whole: the complete backup first (Vizz-backup-DATE.json), after the
  install the conversion of what 2.0 can't read, written back, listed;
  the way back to V15. Where a unit's data comes from: a Vizz by its
  identity (FM-1_8XY is Vizz X.Y: 1.x is Skiff 1.4 inside, 2.x Skiff
  2.0), a development build and any other firmware by its version, as
  Skiff's page
- README.md: the notice; BUILDING.md: the release and the installer

Tests: the splash's lines (ui_render), the L face's strings (ui_test),
the package identity (test_web: FM-1_8xx), MENU > THEME's names
(editor_test's MENU_DESC and test_web: VIZZ for SKIFF).
tests/ui_golden.txt: the splash, ABOUT's four pictures and, in the
default theme, the DISPLAY tab (THEME VIZZ): 76 of 3388; no other
picture changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011Z5NrMFizGcfqt3zdrJXAX
